      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-outline",
      "description": "第二动作：保存本步、测试读取、刷新、重发。",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-btn-outline\">保存本步</button>",
      "css": ".ds-btn-outline{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:28px;padding:0 10px;border:1px solid var(--input,oklch(0.922 0 0));border-radius:10px;background:var(--background,oklch(1 0 0));color:var(--foreground,oklch(0.145 0 0));font:500 12px/1.33 \"Geist Variable\",\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",\"Noto Sans SC\",system-ui,sans-serif;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color .15s cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1)}.ds-btn-outline:hover{background:var(--muted,oklch(0.97 0 0))}.ds-btn-outline:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--ring,oklch(0.55 0 0));outline-offset:2px}.ds-btn-outline:disabled{opacity:.5;pointer-events:none}"
    },
    {
